From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BouBou <69978359+BouBouw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rustic: name_picture hook, a picture in the place of the mark

A platform hook (horizon_hooks::Hooks::name_picture) gives one of the crate's
sprites for a player's name: the player list and the name tag over their head
draw it whole in the mark's 8x8 box (with the text's shadow in the list) and
leave the mark out for that player. Rustic ADR 0012, U14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
